{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）上午11時半左右，警方接報，觀塘駿業街60號駿運工業大廈內，一名男子疑燒炭自殺，昏迷不醒。救援人員到場，證實事主當場不治。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171803336408698880059371.jpeg/XuKw64lKvQfC1EoBwq1RgDfl3OCxMRsniIWqwYiFqsE\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七旬翁在工廈單位內燒炭身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171803333631938560638917.jpeg/WESRMpOSA2wGntH85UtJ0tDUyTI-ZfuFicPQXonD0F4\"/><figcaption>七旬翁在工廈單位內燒炭身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場消息稱，事主留遺書稱生活不開心。單位是停業的貨倉，事主親友因未能與他聯絡，登門找尋而揭發事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171808722343694336605174.jpeg/crq9F33jqgoOKKJoQH_GuoCuB-IIT2Mh0RdQGdEXUBk\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T05:24:03.016555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}